classDiagram
    class Task {
        +str description
        +str time
        +date due_date
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str id
        +str pet_id
        +mark_complete() None
    }
    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +str breed
        +str id
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +list_tasks() list~Task~
        +update_task(task_id, changes) Task
    }
    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +get_pet(pet_id) Pet
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }
    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +sort_by_time(tasks) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name, completed, on_date) list~Task~
        +sort_by_priority(tasks) list~Task~
        +mark_task_complete(task_id, completed_on) Task
        +detect_conflicts(on_date) list~str~
        +build_plan(on_date, available_minutes) tuple
    }
    Owner "1" *-- "0..*" Pet : cares for
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : owns occurrences
    Scheduler --> Owner : calls get_all_tasks
    Scheduler ..> Task : completes and creates next occurrence
